  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 1405.07 Stress Analysis Required",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1405.07 Stress Analysis Required. Pursuant to RSA 321-A:6, in the case of newly developed carnival or amusement rides and altered mechanisms, except for challenge courses and zip lines, carnival or amusement ride operators shall furnish a stress analysis to the commissioner.\n\nSource. #2229, eff 12-31-82; ss by #2950, eff 1-3-85; ss by #4531, eff 1-1-89; ss by #5940, INTERIM, eff 1-1-95; ss by #5952, eff 1-24-95, EXPIRED: 1-24-03\n\nNew. #7833, INTERIM, eff 2-22-03, EXPIRED: 8-21-03\n\nNew. #8045, eff 2-20-04; ss by #10131, eff 5-18-12; ss by #12615, eff 8-28-18; ss by #14139, eff 11-28-24, EXPIRES: 11-28-34 (see Revision Note #3 at chapter heading for Saf-C 1400)",
